# Measuring the Equity of State School Finance Programs

**Authors:** Johns, Thomas L., Magers, Dexter A.

## Abstract
After reviewing attempts to create national school finance equity assessments, the authors propose a model of equity assessment that can be used as a national standard in judging the relative equity of state school finance models. (Author/IRT)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ183210

